# Tutorials

End-to-end walkthroughs. Each tutorial starts from a clean state and walks you
through a complete task, explaining every step.

## Available tutorials

- [Your first card](/tutorials/first-card/) — create a DataCard from a pandas
  DataFrame, save it locally, and register it to a running server.

## What you'll need

- Wyrd set up from a repo checkout ([Get Started](/get-started/))
- Python 3.10+, pandas
